@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
title SysML STM-01 - SignalController lifecycle
[*] --> Running
state Running {
 [*] --> Startup
 state "Startup\nentry / all Red" as Startup
 state "Ready\nentry / requestPlan()" as Ready
 state "Green(i)\nentry / only i Green\nothers Red" as Green
 state "Yellow(i)\nentry / only i Yellow\nothers Red" as Yellow
 state "Clearance\nentry / all Red" as Clearance
 Startup --> Ready : after(1 s)
 Ready --> Green : grant [valid and feasible]\n/ lock i,g; emit grantAccepted(i)
 Green --> Yellow : after(g) [10 <= g <= 30]\n/ set lastGreenEnd(i)
 Yellow --> Clearance : after(3 s)
 Clearance --> Ready : after(1 s) / safeBoundary
}
state "SafetyHold\nentry / all Red\nexit only on restart" as Hold
Running --> Hold : invalidCommand or infeasiblePlan
Hold --> Running : restart / reset model clocks and round
note right of Running
mode = Normal or Fallback is a controller variable,
not a second concurrent signal region.
dataFault latches during any active phase.
Mode/grant changes only at Ready;
recovery additionally requires new round.
end note
@enduml
